displayName: "AI Commander"
name: "ai-commander"
author: "Bond007007007007"
main: "aicommander.AICommanderMod"
description: "Hierarchical LLM Commander AI for Mindustry. A wave-boundary Strategic Doctrine (posture, resource weights, defense focus, squad stance) drives deterministic 60 FPS bot roles: schematic building, conveyor routing, power linking, doctrine-weighted mining, anti-air prioritization, squad tactics, and offline fallback heuristics. Includes an in-game HUD and tactical overlay."
version: "0.12.0"
minGameVersion: "160.3"
java: true
